{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_58_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_58","textTraditional":"一、二十有九年，春，新延廄。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_58_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_58","textTraditional":"新延廄者何？修舊也。脩舊不書，此何以書？譏。何譏爾？凶年不修。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_58_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_58","textTraditional":"二、夏，鄭人侵許。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_58_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_58","textTraditional":"三、秋，有蜚。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_58_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_58","textTraditional":"何以書？記異也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_58_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_58","textTraditional":"四、冬十有二月，紀叔姬卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_58_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_58","textTraditional":"五、城諸及防。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}